### **System Requirements & API Architecture**

| Component | Technology | Role |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Language Detection** | Gemini 1.5 Flash | Automatically identifies Marathi/Hindi/Hinglish. |
| **API Layer** | Next.js Route Handlers | Securely calls the Google AI API without exposing your key. |
| **Clipboard** | `navigator.clipboard` API | One-click copy for the "Purified" text. |
| **Persistence** | LocalStorage | (Optional) To save a history of "Purified" thoughts locally on your browser. |

